                <p>Grant applications took a full day each because staff were repeatedly finding funders and re-entering the same charity information into similar forms.</p>
                <p>quickler built a system that stored the charity’s core information and created draft forms automatically. Staff could enter project needs, get matching funders, and start from pre-filled applications instead of blank pages.</p>
                <p>Eight hours dropped to roughly ten minutes. Across six forms per year, that translated into 6.5 working days returned to higher-value charitable work.</p>
